 exchange of information but lacks nuance.\",\n        \"It is a necessary evolution in the way we communicate.\"\n      ],\n      \"answer\": \"C\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"question_number\": 39,\n      \"question\": \"The word 'ubiquitous' in the passage is most closely related to which of the following meanings?\",\n      \"options\": [\n        \"Extremely rare\",\n        \"Common and widespread\",\n        \"Pervasive in a negative way\",\n        \"Predominant but not the only option\"\n      ],\n      \"answer\": \"B\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"question_number\": 40,\n      \"question\": \"Which sentence best summarizes the passage's main point?\",\n      \"options\": [\n        \"Digital communication has replaced traditional methods of interaction.\",\n        \"The digital age has led to significant changes in how we communicate, with both benefits and challenges.\",\n        \"Phone calls are the most effective way to exchange information.\",\n        \"Social media has become a less significant communication channel.\"\n      ],\n      \"answer\": \"B\"\n    }\n  ]\n}",
